1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,300
Come on, friends!

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,700
Let's spell and count!

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,600
Letters first,

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,400
then say the number!

5
00:00:33,131 --> 00:00:35,360
One bright sun

6
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,489
shining for everyone!

7
00:00:50,964 --> 00:00:53,193
Two little birds

8
00:00:53,193 --> 00:00:55,322
sing tweet tweet too!

9
00:00:55,422 --> 00:00:57,651
Spell it! Say it!

10
00:00:57,651 --> 00:00:59,831
Count with me!

11
00:00:59,881 --> 00:01:02,060
ONE, TWO, THREE!

12
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:04,639
Learning numbers is so much fun!

13
00:01:26,630 --> 00:01:28,859
Three red apples

14
00:01:28,859 --> 00:01:30,988
on the tree!

15
00:01:44,463 --> 00:01:46,692
Four little kittens

16
00:01:46,692 --> 00:01:48,821
play on the floor!

17
00:01:48,921 --> 00:01:51,150
Spell it! Say it!

18
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:53,329
Count with me!

19
00:01:53,379 --> 00:01:55,558
ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR!

20
00:01:55,558 --> 00:01:58,038
Learning numbers is so much fun!

21
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,600
Spell it! Say it!

22
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:11,800
Count again!

23
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:15,900
ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR, FIVE, SIX!

24
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:20,200
SEVEN, EIGHT, NINE, TEN!

25
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,400
We can spell!

26
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:24,300
We can count!

27
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:26,600
Yay!
